  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods assessment design and analysis of Belen market vendors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Animal Protection (WAP), a UK NGO, requested our support in this consultancy related to sustainable livelihoods workshops. Specifically, we are supporting the development of these workshops with 100 low-income vendors from the Belen Market, at least 50% of whom are women, to identify recommendations for diversifying and transforming the livelihoods of illegal wildlife vendors in the Belen Market in Iquitos (Peru).</narrative>
  </description>
